    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ec72434d311741bdb31d3ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征的状况非常糟糕。\n就连平常绝不会失手的球都意外失手了，\n没办法顺利地进洞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de7d80464f890f54aed4141caed0df565d522669d3e477f3d3519cad57023039",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d71673b510a2a9a67185dfb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "游戏继续进行……\n不久后，轮到天狼星象征的回合。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37bbcbf6ef72937f0bc4efd100e012134cea8972eea68d34ed6d7b5ea7105b2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
