    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b97019023e8619db3f42b18",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "九号球就在角落的球袋前，\n八号球也停在那附近。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68d21cfc8d096cca05ac69b61bee7df455b0f82a079c3753a252e0ce0fa93a90",
