    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62d70353d8652513e87c60ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──唔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d080fda71199939d24bf391eee61987694b0b83b9618a63b472930295c90c37f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2191ad34d1b64b9b2cd41830",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的母球偏离了路径──母球洗袋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64f79cf5fcd48091bc7d201bf3f862230c216ed25d4897be578d14d3267be64e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5112c45c41cfba3f6fdb2489",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机会来了。\n我集中精神击球，让母球撞上八号球，\n八号球撞到九号球，最后九号球完美进洞──",
      "source_fingerprint": "476ad4961afae0d27610c962f71b5f418bcd05ccdb0d22f34f11413454b37151",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0602596513e681a65b19e4c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我顺利地赢过状态不佳的她……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9775bb607731c2a3c838a73cae2743cbb97d78fd6ae8334106dfa9d9bde3ad73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8be03fa1cef192bccef8519b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "国外远征要延期了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45ad1de39022e7e9f836433922d91a8c1188b5b00f8a7bd410f8e536ac100c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07b0f16c5ba14587d9db3bc3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……当作没这回事吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "82950c355fd2914a616a01bd2e844da128c561db0abff322857c1a3326b295a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:145228b3045e70d76e3e8fb7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过……我不禁在意起来，\n今天的比赛可以说是公平吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e308520574a46626ca1fa9b1ca030fe846ba1296824b8486e3775e2f51dc611",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5468d921a4bd77eddc6701d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（不过这次要在没让步的情况下取胜）",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b670d4076c8388d10e4551142cfcf771d135ff6092d6ebe6404b68ec040b487",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66631547ceb357d7dfa5f4f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们实力上的差距一目了然。\n目前为止，大部分比赛她都会让步给我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99cba6574234596e8307406bc823d77a5b12125d676de557736297c644d19396",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
