    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ae509383e7bbe74a53fb818",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到底是怎么回事？是因为迷失了梦想，\n还是因为失去了冷静呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e2320cc5880514935f031158097f5d5b719c1d3d73d6726943c295a7ba3977a",
